1762377856","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/258601bcec1e9e2c2763b842b033f8aa2d0c9bfc/ss_258601bcec1e9e2c2763b842b033f8aa2d0c9bfc.600x338.jpg?t=1762377856"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/927b69aa5e715fcf9587f939f2bfe9ea9b132a2f/ss_927b69aa5e715fcf9587f939f2bfe9ea9b132a2f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762377856","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/927b69aa5e715fcf9587f939f2bfe9ea9b132a2f/ss_927b69aa5e715fcf9587f939f2bfe9ea9b132a2f.600x338.jpg?t=1762377856"}],"short_description":"A turn-based RPG following Selva, a retired mercenary; Aurum, a poetic &quot;robot bard&quot;; and allies including engineers, luddite artists, and survivors fighting back against AI-controlled &quot;utopias&quot;. Recruit machines to your side, upgrade with salvaged tech, &amp; explore bizarre pockets of human resistance.","steam_appid":3758170,"support_info":{"email":"RapturousGames@Gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}